(1897, 'elementor_remote_info_feed_data', 'a:5:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"title\";s:58:\"9 Websites With Animations That Inspire Us as Web Creators\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:215:\"Websites with animations are a key ingredient for visual storytelling. Check out these nine examples of websites who’ve added advanced design effects to their sites and have truly mastered the art of animation.​\";s:7:\"created\";s:10:\"1592314235\";s:5:\"badge\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"url\";s:128:\"https://elementor.com/blog/examples-websites-animations/?utm_source=wp-overview-widget&utm_medium=wp-dash&utm_campaign=news-feed\";}i:1;a:5:{s:5:\"title\";s:63:\"What Is WordPress Multisite? How to Set up a Multisite Network?\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:178:\"In this post, we\'ll explain how WordPress Multisite works and when you should use it. In addition, we\'ll show you step-by-step how to create your own WordPress Multisite network.\";s:7:\"created\";s:10:\"1592207160\";s:5:\"badge\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"url\";s:127:\"https://elementor.com/blog/what-is-wordpress-multisite/?utm_source=wp-overview-widget&utm_medium=wp-dash&utm_campaign=news-feed\";}i:2;a:5:{s:5:\"title\";s:54:\"How to Backup Your WordPress Site (Tutorial & Plugins)\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:265:\"Backing up your WordPress site is something that you\'ll absolutely want to learn, to prevent yourself from heartbreak down the road. In this article, we\'re going to make the topic of WordPress backups as painless as possible by covering everything you need to know.\";s:7:\"created\";s:10:\"1591870338\";s:5:\"badge\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"url\";s:116:\"https://elementor.com/blog/backup-wordpress/?utm_source=wp-overview-widget&utm_medium=wp-dash&utm_campaign=news-feed\";}i:3;a:5:{s:5:\"title\";s:42:\"Elementor Sites of the Month – May 2020 \";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:71:\"Here are our top picks of Elementor sites for May 2020. Check them out!\";s:7:\"created\";s:10:\"1591783220\";s:5:\"badge\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"url\";s:117:\"https://elementor.com/blog/showcase-may-2020/?utm_source=wp-overview-w